#ده PKGBUILD محلي 100%، لا يستخدم GitHub ولا git ولا أي مصدر خارجي. ضعه مباشرة داخل مجلد المشروع helwan-words/ 
#بجانب Makefile.

pkgname=hel-words
pkgver=1.0.0
pkgrel=1

pkgdesc="Multilingual word guessing game for Helwan Linux"
arch=('x86_64')

license=('GPL3')

depends=('gtk3')
makedepends=('gcc' 'pkgconf')

source=(
    "Makefile"
    "LICENSE"
    "helwan-words.desktop"
    "data/ar.txt"
    "data/en.txt"
    "data/es.txt"
    "data/icons/helwan-words.png"
    "resources/helwan-words.css"
    "src/main.c"
    "src/game.c"
    "src/game.h"
    "src/ui.c"
    "src/ui.h"
    "src/about.h"
    "src/help.h"
)

build() {
    make \
        CFLAGS="-Wall -Wextra -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags gtk+-3.0)" \
        LIBS="$(pkg-config --libs gtk+-3.0)"
}

package() {
    make \
        DESTDIR="$pkgdir" \
        PREFIX=/usr \
        install

    install -Dm644 LICENSE \
        "$pkgdir/usr/share/licenses/$pkgname/LICENSE"
}

